# "Any number of target creatures" includes zero (CR 107.1c, 601.2d), as Fury's trigger allows: Pyrokinesis may be cast
# choosing no targets even while Bot2 has a creature, and then deals no damage. It used to demand at least one target, so
# the empty division was refused and the cast could not be made. Bot2's Ornithopter is a legal target left unchosen.
[Bot1 Deck]
Pyrokinesis
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x15
[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x16
[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Pyrokinesis.Cast(Ability: Exile)
Bot1.Divide()
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Pyrokinesis
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 0
Exile = Lightning Bolt
